<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-114.1-dg-classification-inventory-and-program-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3593" name="W3593. DG/Hazmat Compliance Program Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual compliance/HSE planning (links to VS-24/VS-22); regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise DG/hazmat program
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, HSE (links to VS-24), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Compliance/Regulatory (links to VS-22), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Sustainability (links to VS-25)
Source: workflow W3593 — DG/Hazmat Compliance Program Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3593_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3593_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3593_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3593_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3593_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3593_Lane2" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3593_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3593_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3593_Start4" name="Annual compliance/HSE planning (links to VS-24/VS-22); regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3593_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3593_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE define the DG compliance program strategy and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/HSE define the DG compliance program strategy and governance: scope (the DG-intensive categories — paint/solvents, adhesives/thinners, aerosols, garden chemicals, cleaning chemicals, fuels/lubricants, gas cylinders, lithium batteries, cement/silica), the regulatory map (DENR-EMB RA 6969, BFP Fire Code, DOLE OSH, MARINA/Coast Guard, CAB, LTFRB/DOTr, IMDG/IATA/ADR), the program operating model, and the KPIs (compliance %, incidents, carrier refusals, audit findings)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3593_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3593_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3593_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer establish the DG governance: DG Compliance Officer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer establish the DG governance: DG Compliance Officer role/authority, the DG committee, cross-functional responsibilities (Merchandising classifies, Logistics ships, Ecommerce lists, DC/Store stores, HSE protects workers), the policy/standards, and the integration to HSE (VS-24.3), quality (VS-31), and recall (VS-89)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3593_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3593_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3593_Task7" name="VP Legal/COO approve the DG program strategy and policy, ratify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal/COO approve the DG program strategy and policy, ratify governance/authorities, allocate the program budget (links to VS-34/VS-17.4), and report DG compliance posture to the executive risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36) and board (links to VS-36); communicate the mandate
Responsible (R): VP Legal / COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3593_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3593_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3593_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3593_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3593_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-156 (ensure dangerous-goods transport &amp; training compliance.) | - operational: DG Compliance Officer authority; operational: risk-committee reporting and quantified exposure
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3593_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3593_Annotation9" targetRef="W3593_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3593_Flow11" sourceRef="W3593_Start4" targetRef="W3593_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3593_Flow12" sourceRef="W3593_Task5" targetRef="W3593_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3593_Flow13" sourceRef="W3593_Task6" targetRef="W3593_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3593_Flow14" sourceRef="W3593_Task7" targetRef="W3593_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
