    <bpmn:process id="W_W3594" name="W3594. DG Product Classification (UN/IMDG/IATA/ADR) &amp; Master Data" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New SKU/NPI (links to VS-01.1); vendor/private-label onboarding; regulatory update
Frequency: Per SKU + on update
Volume: ~2,800–3,500 DG-intensive SKUs (8–10% of 35K assortment)
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Merchandising
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Merchandising/Category (links to VS-01), Private Label (links to VS-41), Master Data (links to VS-29), Quality (links to VS-31), Import (links to VS-87), Supplier, Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03)
Source: workflow W3594 — DG Product Classification (UN/IMDG/IATA/ADR) &amp; Master Data</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3594_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3594_Lane1" name="DG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3594_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3594_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3594_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3594_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3594_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3594_Start3" name="New SKU/NPI (links to VS-01.1); vendor/private-label onboarding; regulatory update">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3594_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3594_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Merchandising classify each DG SKU against the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Merchandising classify each DG SKU against the modal regulations: UN number, proper shipping name, hazard class/division (1–9), packing group (I/II/III), subsidiary risks, special provisions, and the modal-specific classification (IMDG sea, IATA air, ADR/DOT road); obtain vendor/manufacturer classification or commission expert classification
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Merchandising / Supplier
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3594_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3594_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3594_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Master Data capture the DG classification in the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Master Data capture the DG classification in the item/hazmat master (links to VS-29): UN number, class, packing group, DG flag, transport-eligibility by mode (air/sea/road), ecommerce ship-eligibility flag (W3604), restricted-quantity/limited-quantity thresholds, and the linked SDS (W3595); maintain through the product lifecycle (links to VS-01.1)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Master Data
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3594_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3594_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3594_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Quality validate classification for private-label…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Quality validate classification for private-label and high-risk SKUs (links to VS-41/VS-31), manage classification disputes/updates on regulatory change (W3596), and feed classification to transport (W3602–W3605), ecommerce (W3604), and storage (W3609) compliance; audit classification accuracy
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Quality
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3594_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3594_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3594_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3594_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3594_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-571 (ensure controlled execution — DG Classification, Inventory &amp; Program Governance (PA-114.1).) | - operational: expert classification and validation; operational: mandatory DG attributes at SKU setup
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3594_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3594_Annotation8" targetRef="W3594_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3594_Flow10" sourceRef="W3594_Start3" targetRef="W3594_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3594_Flow11" sourceRef="W3594_Task4" targetRef="W3594_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3594_Flow12" sourceRef="W3594_Task5" targetRef="W3594_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3594_Flow13" sourceRef="W3594_Task6" targetRef="W3594_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
