      <bpmn:userTask id="W3596_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Compliance monitor DG regulatory developments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Compliance monitor DG regulatory developments: DENR-EMB rules/RA 6969 amendments, BFP Fire Code, DOLE OSH, MARINA/Coast Guard sea-DG, CAB air-DG, LTFRB/DOTr road-DG, international modal updates (IMDG/IATA/ADR biennial updates), and LGU ordinances; source from regulators, associations (links to VS-104), and counsel
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3596_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3596_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3596_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer assess the impact of regulatory change on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer assess the impact of regulatory change on BuildRight: classification updates (W3594), packaging/marking (W3598), transport rules (W3601–W3603), ecommerce eligibility (W3604), storage (W3609), training (W3597), and reporting; produce the change-impact assessment and compliance plan
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3596_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3596_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3596_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer implement the compliance plan: update master…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer implement the compliance plan: update master data/SDS (W3594/W3595), standards (W3598), carrier contracts (W3601), ecommerce rules (W3604), and training (W3597); validate compliance and report to governance (W3616) and the regulatory-change process (links to VS-22.3)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3596_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3596_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3596_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3596_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
