        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-156 (ensure dangerous-goods transport &amp; training compliance.) | - operational: monitoring and association engagement; operational: change-impact plan and validation
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
