    <bpmn:process id="W_W3597" name="W3597. DG Training, Certification &amp; Competency Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New hire/role; regulatory cycle (W3596); incident/near-miss
Frequency: Per role + recurring (annual/biennial per regulation)
Volume: DG-handling workforce (DC hazmat staff, drivers, ecommerce packers, store paint/chemical staff, supervisors)
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / HSE
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, HSE (links to VS-24), HR/L&amp;D (links to VS-19.3/VS-103), Logistics (links to VS-06), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Store Operations (links to VS-07)
Source: workflow W3597 — DG Training, Certification &amp; Competency Management</bpmn:documentation>
