    <bpmn:process id="W_W3598" name="W3598. DG Transport Packaging, Marking &amp; Labeling Standards" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: SKU classification (W3594); packaging spec; regulatory change (W3596)
Frequency: Per SKU + maintained
Volume: DG-intensive SKUs requiring UN-certified transport packaging
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Packaging
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Packaging Eng (links to VS-111), Quality (links to VS-31), Import (links to VS-87), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Supplier, Private Label (links to VS-41)
Source: workflow W3598 — DG Transport Packaging, Marking &amp; Labeling Standards</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3598_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3598_Lane1" name="DG">
