      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3598_Start3" name="SKU classification (W3594); packaging spec; regulatory change (W3596)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3598_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3598_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Packaging specify the DG transport packaging per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Packaging specify the DG transport packaging per SKU: UN-certified packaging (design-type tested to the packing group), inner/outer packaging, absorbents for liquids, quantity limits (limited-quantity/excepted-quantity thresholds), and compatibility; align to IMDG/IATA/ADR packaging instructions
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Packaging Eng
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3598_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3598_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3598_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Packaging specify the DG marking and labeling: UN…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Packaging specify the DG marking and labeling: UN number marking, proper shipping name, hazard class labels (diamond labels), orientation arrows, &quot;LQ&quot;/&quot;EQ&quot; marks, lithium-battery handling marks, and overpack marking; specify placarding for transport units (links to W3602); align to modal rules
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Packaging Eng
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3598_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3598_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3598_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Quality validate DG packaging/marking compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Quality validate DG packaging/marking compliance on incoming (links to VS-31) and private-label (links to VS-41), audit vendor compliance (W3525-style), manage non-compliance and chargeback (links to VS-03), and capture the spec in the item/packaging master (links to VS-111/VS-29); feed to transport (W3602) and ecommerce (W3604)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Quality
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3598_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3598_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3598_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3598_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
