        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-571 (ensure controlled execution — DG Classification, Inventory &amp; Program Governance (PA-114.1).) | - operational: packaging spec and incoming validation; operational: marking spec and audit
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Packaging</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
