    <bpmn:process id="W_W3599" name="W3599. DG Procurement, Vendor &amp; Import Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor/private-label onboarding (links to VS-03.1/VS-41); import PO (links to VS-02.2/VS-87)
Frequency: Per onboarding + per import
Volume: DG vendors and DG import shipments (~40% import)
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Procurement
Participants: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer, Procurement/Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Import (links to VS-02.2/VS-87), Private Label (links to VS-41), Quality (links to VS-31), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Logistics (links to VS-06)
Source: workflow W3599 — DG Procurement, Vendor &amp; Import Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
