      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3599_Start3" name="Vendor/private-label onboarding (links to VS-03.1/VS-41); import PO (links to…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3599_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3599_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Vendor Mgmt incorporate DG compliance into…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Vendor Mgmt incorporate DG compliance into vendor/private-label onboarding (links to VS-03.1/VS-41): vendor obligation to provide accurate classification (W3594), SDS (W3595), UN-certified packaging/marking (W3598), and transport documentation (W3602); supplier qualification for DG; contractual compliance and indemnity
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Vendor Mgmt / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / VP Legal
Duration: Per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3599_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3599_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3599_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Import ensure DG import compliance: import…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Import ensure DG import compliance: import classification/customs (links to VS-87), DG import documentation, port/terminal DG handling (links to W3607), IMDG sea-transport compliance (W3603), and DENR import notification/permit for regulated chemicals; coordinate with broker (links to VS-02.2)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Import
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per import</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3599_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3599_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3599_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Quality audit DG vendor/import compliance, manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Quality audit DG vendor/import compliance, manage non-compliance and chargeback (links to VS-03/VS-90), and track vendor DG performance in the scorecard (links to VS-67); report vendor/import DG risk to governance (W3616)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Quality / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3599_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3599_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3599_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3599_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
