        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-156 (ensure dangerous-goods transport &amp; training compliance.) | - operational: onboarding obligation and audit; operational: pre-shipment compliance check
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
