        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3600_Start3" name="Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3600_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3600_Task4" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Audit maintain the DG documentation and records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Audit maintain the DG documentation and records: classifications (W3594), SDS (W3595), training records (W3597), transport documents (W3602), carrier agreements (W3601), incident reports (W3613), permits (W3614), and DENR/DOLE/BFP filings; retention per regulation and VS-88 (typically 3–10 years)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Records
Accountable (A): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3600_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3600_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3600_Task5" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Audit conduct the annual DG compliance audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer/Audit conduct the annual DG compliance audit: classification accuracy, SDS coverage, training currency, packaging/marking compliance, transport-documentation completeness, storage compliance (links to VS-24.3), ecommerce eligibility (W3604), and incident closure; internal and third-party/DENR-accredited
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3600_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3600_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3600_Task6" name="DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer manage findings to closure, support regulatory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer manage findings to closure, support regulatory inspections (DENR-EMB/DOLE/BFP/MARINA/CAB) and audit response (links to VS-22/W77), and report DG audit posture and findings to governance (W3616), audit committee (links to VS-21/VS-36), and risk (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Audit / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3600_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3600_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3600_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3600_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3600_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-156 (ensure dangerous-goods transport &amp; training compliance.) | - operational: documentation discipline and retention; operational: closure tracking and governance reporting
Owner: DG/Hazmat Compliance Officer / Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
